<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" modified="2026-10-25T00:00:00.000Z" agent="LivingDocs Agent" version="24.0.0" type="device"><diagram id="diag_state_machine" name="1. UML State Machine - Vong Doi Tai Lieu"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1500" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="t1" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px;color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;HỆ THỐNG LIVINGDOCS — SƠ ĐỒ UML STATE MACHINE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#475569;&quot;&gt;Vòng đời trạng thái toàn diện của Tài liệu (Document Lifecycle &amp;amp; Transition Rules)&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;rounded=1;shadow=1;align=center;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="20" width="1380" height="50" /></mxCell><mxCell id="init" parent="1" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="200" width="28" height="28" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s_draft" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#0369A1;&quot;&gt;DRAFT (Bản nháp)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#BAE6FD;&quot;/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:11px;color:#0C4A6E;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;• Khởi tạo phiên bản v1 (Genesis Hash)&lt;br/&gt;• Cho phép chỉnh sửa tự sinh v(N+1)&lt;br/&gt;• Quyền: Tác giả (DEV / TechLead / AI)&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E0F2FE;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;arcSize=14;shadow=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="160" y="165" width="230" height="95" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_init_draft" parent="1" value="createDocument()&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#64748B;&quot;&gt;sinh v1 &amp;amp; Genesis Hash&lt;/span&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor:#0369A1;align=center;" edge="1" source="init" target="s_draft"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_draft_self" parent="1" value="updateDocument()&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0284C7;&quot;&gt;[Nội dung mới -&gt; tăng v(N+1)]&lt;/span&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor:#0369A1;curved=1;" edge="1" source="s_draft" target="s_draft"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="230" y="165" /><mxPoint x="230" y="120" /><mxPoint x="320" y="120" /><mxPoint x="320" y="165" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="s_staff" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#B45309;&quot;&gt;UNDER_REVIEW_STAFF&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#FDE68A;&quot;/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:11px;color:#78350F;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;• Hàng đợi rà soát Cấp 1 của Staff&lt;br/&gt;• Đối chiếu code AST &amp;amp; cấu trúc doc&lt;br/&gt;• Quyền duyệt: STAFF, MANAGER, ADMIN&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;arcSize=14;shadow=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="500" y="165" width="240" height="95" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_draft_staff" parent="1" value="submitForReview()&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#475569;&quot;&gt;[Tác giả gửi duyệt]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#16A34A;&quot;&gt;/ ghi log DOCUMENT_SUBMITTED&lt;/span&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor:#B45309;align=center;" edge="1" source="s_draft" target="s_staff"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s_manager" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#6D28D9;&quot;&gt;UNDER_REVIEW_MANAGER&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#DDD6FE;&quot;/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:11px;color:#4C1D95;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;• Trung tâm phê duyệt Cấp 2 của Manager&lt;br/&gt;• Thẩm định nghiệp vụ &amp;amp; quyết định ký duyệt&lt;br/&gt;• Quyền duyệt: CHỈ MANAGER, ADMIN&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#EDE9FE;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;arcSize=14;shadow=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="850" y="165" width="250" height="95" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_staff_mgr" parent="1" value="handleStaffAction(APPROVE)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#475569;&quot;&gt;[Staff duyệt Cấp 1 đạt chuẩn]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#16A34A;&quot;&gt;/ ghi log DOCUMENT_STAFF_REVIEWED&lt;/span&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor:#6D28D9;align=center;" edge="1" source="s_staff" target="s_manager"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s_pub" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#047857;&quot;&gt;PUBLISHED (Đã xuất bản)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#A7F3D0;&quot;/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:11px;color:#064E3B;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;• Tài liệu chính thức phát hành&lt;br/&gt;• Tự động đẩy commit Markdown lên GitHub&lt;br/&gt;• Trạng thái kết thúc an toàn, bất biến&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#D1FAE5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;arcSize=14;shadow=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1200" y="165" width="230" height="95" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_mgr_pub" parent="1" value="handleManagerAction(PUBLISH)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#475569;&quot;&gt;[Manager ký duyệt Cấp 2]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#16A34A;&quot;&gt;/ push commit GitHub &amp;amp; ghi log&lt;/span&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontColor:#047857;align=center;" edge="1" source="s_manager" target="s_pub"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="final" parent="1" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#064E3B;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1305" y="305" width="26" height="26" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_pub_final" parent="1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" source="s_pub" target="final"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_mgr_return" parent="1" value="handleManagerAction(RETURN_STAFF)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#B45309;&quot;&gt;[Manager yêu cầu Staff rà soát lại] / log DOCUMENT_RETURNED_STAFF&lt;/span&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeFactor=1;fontSize=11;fontColor:#B45309;curved=1;dashed=1;" edge="1" source="s_manager" target="s_staff"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="960" y="165" /><mxPoint x="960" y="105" /><mxPoint x="630" y="105" /><mxPoint x="630" y="165" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="s_rej" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#BE123C;&quot;&gt;REJECTED (Bị từ chối)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#FECDD3;&quot;/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:11px;color:#881337;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;• Tài liệu không đạt yêu cầu chất lượng&lt;br/&gt;• Lưu lý do từ chối vào bảng reviews &amp;amp; audit_logs&lt;br/&gt;• Tác giả được phép mở lại &amp;amp; sửa chữa&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFE4E6;strokeColor=#E11D48;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;arcSize=14;shadow=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="680" y="350" width="240" height="95" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_staff_rej" parent="1" value="handleStaffAction(REJECT)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#BE123C;&quot;&gt;[Staff từ chối kèm ghi chú]&lt;/span&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#E11D48;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor:#BE123C;dashed=1;" edge="1" source="s_staff" target="s_rej"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="580" y="260" /><mxPoint x="580" y="395" /><mxPoint x="680" y="395" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_mgr_rej" parent="1" value="handleManagerAction(REJECT)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#BE123C;&quot;&gt;[Manager từ chối xuất bản]&lt;/span&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#E11D48;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor:#BE123C;dashed=1;" edge="1" source="s_manager" target="s_rej"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="970" y="260" /><mxPoint x="970" y="395" /><mxPoint x="920" y="395" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_rej_draft" parent="1" value="updateDocument() / Tác giả chỉnh sửa khắc phục&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0284C7;&quot;&gt;[Tạo phiên bản v(N+1) tiếp theo, nối tiếp chuỗi băm]&lt;/span&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor:#0369A1;curved=1;" edge="1" source="s_rej" target="s_draft"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="680" y="410" /><mxPoint x="275" y="410" /><mxPoint x="275" y="260" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_pub_rollback" parent="1" value="rollbackToVersion(targetVersion)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#475569;&quot;&gt;[Khôi phục phiên bản cũ an toàn -&gt; Sinh v(N+1)]&lt;/span&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor:#334155;dashed=1;curved=1;" edge="1" source="s_pub" target="s_draft"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1240" y="260" /><mxPoint x="1240" y="460" /><mxPoint x="230" y="460" /><mxPoint x="230" y="260" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="legend_box" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;BẢNG QUY TẮC PHÂN QUYỀN VÀ TRUY VẾT KIỂM TOÁN (AUDIT TRAIL)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#CBD5E1;&quot;/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:11px;color:#334155;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Gửi duyệt (DRAFT ➔ STAFF)&lt;/b&gt;: Tác giả tài liệu (DEVELOPER, TECH_LEAD, STAFF, MANAGER, ADMIN). Ghi log: &lt;code&gt;DOCUMENT_SUBMITTED&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Duyệt Cấp 1 (STAFF ➔ MANAGER / REJECTED)&lt;/b&gt;: Người có vai trò &lt;b&gt;STAFF&lt;/b&gt; hoặc &lt;b&gt;MANAGER&lt;/b&gt;. Ghi log: &lt;code&gt;DOCUMENT_STAFF_REVIEWED&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;DOCUMENT_REJECTED&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Duyệt Cấp 2 (MANAGER ➔ PUBLISHED / RETURN_STAFF)&lt;/b&gt;: Nghiêm ngặt chỉ &lt;b&gt;MANAGER&lt;/b&gt; hoặc &lt;b&gt;ADMIN&lt;/b&gt;. Ghi log: &lt;code&gt;DOCUMENT_PUBLISHED&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;DOCUMENT_RETURNED_STAFF&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Chuỗi băm toàn vẹn (Hash Chain)&lt;/b&gt;: Mỗi phiên bản sinh mã SHA-256 kế thừa &lt;code&gt;prev_hash&lt;/code&gt; phiên bản trước. Khôi phục (Rollback) không xóa lịch sử.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="160" y="490" width="1100" height="120" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="diag_sequence" name="2. UML Sequence - Luong Duyet 2 Cap"><mxGraphModel dx="1500" dy="1100" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="sq_title" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px;color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;HỆ THỐNG LIVINGDOCS — SƠ ĐỒ UML SEQUENCE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#475569;&quot;&gt;Tuần tự tương tác Quy trình Phê duyệt 2 Cấp (Staff Reviewer &amp;amp; Project Manager)&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;rounded=1;shadow=1;align=center;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="20" width="1460" height="50" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_staff" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#B45309;&quot;&gt;Staff: Reviewer&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;shadow=1;align=center;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="70" y="90" width="130" height="45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_staff_line" parent="1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;" edge="1" source="p_staff"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="135" y="135" /><mxPoint x="135" y="920" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_mgr" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#6D28D9;&quot;&gt;Manager: ProjectManager&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#EDE9FE;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;shadow=1;align=center;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="270" y="90" width="130" height="45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_mgr_line" parent="1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;" edge="1" source="p_mgr"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="335" y="135" /><mxPoint x="335" y="920" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_ctrl" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#0369A1;&quot;&gt;ReviewController&#10;«REST API»&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E0F2FE;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;shadow=1;align=center;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="490" y="90" width="130" height="45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_ctrl_line" parent="1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;" edge="1" source="p_ctrl"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="555" y="135" /><mxPoint x="555" y="920" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_svc" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;ReviewService / DocumentService&#10;«Application»&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;shadow=1;align=center;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="740" y="90" width="130" height="45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_svc_line" parent="1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;" edge="1" source="p_svc"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="805" y="135" /><mxPoint x="805" y="920" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_sm" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#991B1B;&quot;&gt;DocumentStateMachine&#10;«Domain Core»&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FEE2E2;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;shadow=1;align=center;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1010" y="90" width="130" height="45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_sm_line" parent="1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;" edge="1" source="p_sm"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1075" y="135" /><mxPoint x="1075" y="920" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_audit" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#3730A3;&quot;&gt;AuditLogService&#10;«Port / Adapter»&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E0E7FF;strokeColor=#4F46E5;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;shadow=1;align=center;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1210" y="90" width="130" height="45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_audit_line" parent="1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;" edge="1" source="p_audit"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1275" y="135" /><mxPoint x="1275" y="920" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_db" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#166534;&quot;&gt;Database &amp; GitHub&#10;«PostgreSQL / API»&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;shadow=1;align=center;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1390" y="90" width="130" height="45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_db_line" parent="1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;" edge="1" source="p_db"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1455" y="135" /><mxPoint x="1455" y="920" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="grp_phase1" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#B45309;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;GIAI ĐOẠN 1: STAFF RÀ SOÁT &amp;amp; DUYỆT CẤP 1 (UNDER_REVIEW_STAFF ➔ UNDER_REVIEW_MANAGER)&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#FCD34D;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;dashed=1;opacity=70;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="50" y="150" width="1440" height="320" /></mxCell><mxCell id="m1" parent="1" value="1. GET /api/reviews/staff/queue" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor:#0369A1;" edge="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="135" y="185" /><mxPoint x="555" y="185" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m2" parent="1" value="2. getStaffQueue()" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor:#0F172A;" edge="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="555" y="205" /><mxPoint x="805" y="205" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m3" parent="1" value="3. findByStatus(UNDER_REVIEW_STAFF)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor:#166534;" edge="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="805" y="220" /><mxPoint x="1455" y="220" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m4" parent="1" value="4. Danh sách tài liệu kèm Repo &amp; Tác giả" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor:#166534;" edge="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1455" y="240" /><mxPoint x="805" y="240" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m5" parent="1" value="5. 200 OK (Danh sách hàng đợi)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor:#0369A1;" edge="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="555" y="255" /><mxPoint x="135" y="255" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m6" parent="1" value="6. POST /api/reviews/{id}/staff-action { decision: &quot;APPROVE&quot;, comment: &quot;AST &amp; code chuẩn&quot; }" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor:#B45309;" edge="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><A